since a Chassis/Fitting has no standalone existence as an actor-owned Item for Foundry's transfer
mechanism to attach to; that would need its own future design pass, not a quick extension of this
one. Moved `parseSigned` from `equipment-features.mjs` into `utils.mjs` so both modules share one
parse instead of drifting. **Known limitation**: items created/owned before this version won't get
their embedded effect until next edited (no bulk backfill was run, deliberately, to avoid a hook
silently creating a pile of new embedded Documents across every actor on world load without being
asked — consistent with this repo's "no data migration system" gap already on record).

