re-derived — so each new Apply Damage call only ever computes the DELTA from that stored count using
the current Resilience for the NEW total, never retroactively touching what already converted. Reset
alongside `accumulatedDamage` in `EssenceCombat#_onStartTurn`, same boundary. Traced through by hand:
